    Knowledge: the fourth judgement round's defects
    
    A repository whose .git holds anything but regular files and folders is refused
    before git runs. The write with its record and undo, and the rule that sets a
    refused repository aside, each live in one place.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

